          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.3618643,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Please set your phone to silent and take calls outside. Photography and video recording are not allowed in the waiting area, to protect other patients' privacy.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.34456313,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or type in your last name and date of birth. The kiosk cannot take payments: any copay or self-pay amount is paid at the front desk.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 27,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3322789,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 33,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.32619134,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## Checking in on time\n\nCheck in at the front desk or at the self-check-in kiosk as soon as you arrive. Your arrival is recorded when you check in, not when you enter the building.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 35,
